# An animated GIF in the preview pane: it plays on its own, loops, and has a seek bar that shows
# each frame as the thumb passes it. A still GIF gets no transport at all.
#
# The fixture's frames: 0 is blue with a red bar (0–200 ms), 1 adds a green square that clears
# itself afterwards (200–400 ms), 2 is a checkered red corner declaring 0 ms, which plays at
# 100 ms (400–500 ms). So frame 2 over frame 1's cleared square shows blue in the middle again.

tree .
gif-fixture
refresh
go Gif
preview on

# --- plays as soon as it is selected ---

select spinner.gif
settle 400
assert-preview image
assert-gif playing
shot 01-playing PreviewPane

# --- held, then scrubbed: each position shows its own frame ---

gif pause
assert-gif paused
gif seek 250
assert-gif frame 1
shot 02-frame1 PreviewPane
gif seek 450
assert-gif frame 2
shot 03-frame2 PreviewPane
gif seek 0
assert-gif frame 0

# A seek while paused stays paused, so the frame chosen is the frame that stays up.
settle 300
assert-gif frame 0
assert-gif paused

# --- and resumes, looping rather than stopping on the last frame ---

gif play
settle 1200
assert-gif playing

# --- a big one shows its first frame and plays while the rest are still decoding ---
#
# Nothing waits for all 150 frames: the preview is up at "image" within the ordinary settle. A
# seek to the end while the tail is still decoding holds the last frame there is, and fills in
# the frame asked for once it lands — without seeking again, and while paused.

select big.gif
settle 400
assert-preview image
assert-gif playing
shot 06-big PreviewPane
gif pause
gif seek 5999
settle 3000
assert-gif frame 149
assert-gif paused

# --- a one-frame GIF is just a picture ---

select still.gif
settle 400
assert-preview image
assert-gif none
shot 04-still PreviewPane

# --- and back to the animation, which starts over and plays by itself again ---

select spinner.gif
settle 400
assert-gif playing

# --- the light theme, for the transport strip ---

gif pause
gif seek 250
theme light-plus
shot 05-light PreviewPane
theme dark-plus

# Hiding the pane stops the clock; showing it again resumes only what was playing.
gif play
preview off
preview on
settle 200
assert-gif playing
